    "Raw environment mappings/lists and arbitrary container-like absolute strings are refused; the inventory exception is limited to the synthetic container record format.",
    "Export and partial-output cleanup failures retain both exceptions; resource cleanup and archive-removal failures are propagated together.",
    "Negative tests rebind enclosing hashes so latency/warmup/journal cases reach their intended validators; byte-exact successful export, reduced subprocess environment, timeout/TERM and cleanup paths are covered."
